    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικείρω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέκερσα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut off, cut down</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρώτας
				ἐπέκερσε</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάλαγγας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.394
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχους ὀδόντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					5.108
				</span></i>
			; <i>cut down</i> growing corn, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν
